    {
      "id": "6ac8e90645ca7d57a9ed5676",
      "text": "Geminiたん",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791551752,
      "updated": 1791551758
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8e91800000000001bc545",
      "text": "[非公式マスコット]・[萌え擬人化]キャラクター",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791551769,
      "updated": 1791551835
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8e97c00000000001bc547",
      "text": "作者：るな（X (Twtter): @Luna11054）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791551869,
      "updated": 1791551952
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8f5790000000000ff1eef",
      "text": "\t注：イラストレーターではないそうです[. https://x.com/Luna11054/status/2101892333705076757]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791554937,
      "updated": 1791554981
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8e92d00000000001bc546",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791551789,
      "updated": 1791551789
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8ea5300000000001bc548",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791552084,
      "updated": 1791552084
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8ea7200000000001bc54f",
      "text": "\t> [@Luna11054 2026-10-08 https://x.com/Luna11054/status/2108324810472435924]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791552114,
      "updated": 1791552243
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8ea5500000000001bc54a",
      "text": " > 目と口が大事なGeminiたん",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791552086,
      "updated": 1791552129
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8ea8200000000001bc551",
      "text": " > [https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTnHu9gaAAAnfdb?format=jpg&name=orig#.png]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791552130,
      "updated": 1791552148
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8f3480000000000ff1ec0",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791554377,
      "updated": 1791554428
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8f6910000000000ff1f03",
      "text": "どのように[キャラづくり]をしているのかを具体的に明言しているのは珍しい",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791555218,
      "updated": 1791555801
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8f3870000000000ff1ec6",
      "text": "\t> [@Luna11054 午後1:02 · 2026年9月23日 https://x.com/Luna11054/status/2102609400158638171]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791554439,
      "updated": 1791554466
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8f3890000000000ff1ec8",
      "text": " > ◇Geminiたんシリーズの戦略",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791554441,
      "updated": 1791554441
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8f3890000000000ff1ec9",
      "text": " > ・[キャラ付け]、個性強調、ブランドカラー",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791554441,
      "updated": 1791555320
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8f3890000000000ff1eca",
      "text": " > ・引用活用、他人との絡み",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791554441,
      "updated": 1791554441
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8f3890000000000ff1ecb",
      "text": " > ・[時事ネタ]/[風刺]取り入れ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791554441,
      "updated": 1791555347
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8f3890000000000ff1ecc",
      "text": " > ⇒医療アカでの「得意」の再現",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791554441,
      "updated": 1791554441
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8f3890000000000ff1ecd",
      "text": " > ・文章でフック、シンプルなコマ割りの漫画化",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791554441,
      "updated": 1791554441
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8f3890000000000ff1ece",
      "text": " > ・構図とキャラ再活用パズル、差分による省力化",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791554441,
      "updated": 1791554441
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8f3890000000000ff1ecf",
      "text": " > ⇒「努力と労力」を最小化",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791554441,
      "updated": 1791554441
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8f3890000000000ff1ed0",
      "text": " > 初めに立てたCore戦略は、",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791554441,
      "updated": 1791554441
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8f3890000000000ff1ed1",
      "text": " > 「最小限の労力でクラスタを越えろ」",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791554441,
      "updated": 1791554441
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8f3890000000000ff1ed2",
      "text": " > 上手くいったかな。",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791554441,
      "updated": 1791554441
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8f3870000000000ff1ec7",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791554439,
      "updated": 1791554439
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8f3480000000000ff1ec1",
      "text": " > [@Luna11054 2026-09-26 https://x.com/Luna11054/status/2103835340268343437]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791554377,
      "updated": 1791554423
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8f3500000000000ff1ec2",
      "text": " > ◇Geminiたんシリーズの戦略2",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791554384,
      "updated": 1791554384
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8f3500000000000ff1ec3",
      "text": " > ・ネタに応じて見た目をカスタムする",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791554384,
      "updated": 1791554384
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8f3500000000000ff1ec4",
      "text": " > キャラが構築されたあとで、そのキャラの役目に応じて、少し大人にしたり可愛くしたり、デフォルメしたり。役割を演じてもらう。統一にこだわらない",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791554384,
      "updated": 1791554384
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8f3500000000000ff1ec5",
      "text": " > はじめだけ統一感は強くしてたつもり。反応見るとまだ変えるのは早かった感はある",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791554384,
      "updated": 1791554384
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8eb9900000000001bc56d",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791552409,
      "updated": 1791552409
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8ec5b00000000001bc57f",
      "text": " > RT [\" [@minorun365 2026-10-08 https://x.com/minorun365/status/2108101087433760853] Haiku 5.5、ファーストインプレッションはGemini ]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791552604,
      "updated": 1791553407
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8eb9700000000001bc56c",
      "text": "\t> [@Luna11054 2026-10-08 https://x.com/Luna11054/status/2108160701638582781] 俳句を詠むGeminiたん ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791552408,
      "updated": 1791553400
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8ef780000000000ff1e86",
      "text": " > 【添付画像1枚】",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791553400,
      "updated": 1791553400
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8ef2a0000000000ff1e85",
      "text": "\t\tGeminiたん「[\" あきふかし きみもわたしも じぇみにたん]」",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791553322,
      "updated": 1791553353
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8eace00000000001bc553",
      "text": "  [\" [@ru__ru__ru__ru https://x.com/ru__ru__ru__ru/status/2108163517216141563] Geminiたん俳句大会の会場はここで良いでしょうか？]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791552206,
      "updated": 1791552283
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8ead500000000001bc554",
      "text": "   > [@Luna11054 https://x.com/Luna11054/status/2108164092724986115]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791552213,
      "updated": 1791552304
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8ead700000000001bc558",
      "text": "   > あきふかし",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791552216,
      "updated": 1791552216
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8ead700000000001bc559",
      "text": "   > きみも[ぽんこつ]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791552216,
      "updated": 1791552512
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8ead700000000001bc55a",
      "text": "   > なかまいり",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791552216,
      "updated": 1791552345
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8eb3d00000000001bc560",
      "text": "    > [@ru__ru__ru__ru https://x.com/ru__ru__ru__ru/status/2108164432144847165]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791552317,
      "updated": 1791552343
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8eb3d00000000001bc563",
      "text": "    > よんになったら",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791552317,
      "updated": 1791552317
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8eb3d00000000001bc564",
      "text": "    > かしこくなるの",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791552317,
      "updated": 1791552317
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac8ea8000000000001bc550",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791552129,
      "updated": 1791552129
    },
    {
